Package: mdglass
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, librsvg2-2, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: fast markdown viewer: terminal pager and GNOME preview
 mdglass renders markdown in the terminal with colors, tables, highlighted
 code blocks and clickable links, in a built-in less-style pager with search;
 piped output is plain, word-wrapped text. mdglass --gui opens a native GNOME
 (GTK4/libadwaita) preview window with find, zoom and live reload.
 .
 The GNOME libraries are loaded at runtime, so the terminal viewer works
 without them.
